From 92eaafdc6a75b5280944169b9f211a0f00947ddf Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: reaper <theunbounddeveloper@outlook.com>
Date: Mon, 6 Jul 2026 14:14:40 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] www: reaper-theme the sign-in page (Main_Login.asp)

Replace the stock blue/teal login styling with the reaper design
language: matte black bg with crimson radials + vignette + film grain,
centered panel card with crimson top rule, REAPER wordmark, Rajdhani/
Inter self-hosted fonts, black inputs with crimson focus, crimson
gradient sign-in button, amber warning hints, dark panels for the
logout/no-login views and captcha row.

Style-block + title rewrite only: all DOM ids/classes and the whole
login JS (nonce/SHA-256 flow, captcha, lockout states) are untouched.
ASCII-only verified (0 non-ASCII bytes).
